  "cited_article_id": "configure-automated-reminders",
  "reply": "To change the wording and schedule of text and email booking notifications, go to **Settings > Communications > Reminders**. Select **Edit** next to the SMS or Email channel, modify the template using allowed merge tags (e.g., [PatientName], [AppointmentTime]), and set the dispatch window between 24 and 72 hours before the visit. Ensure each patient has a verified mobile number or email and has opted in for communications. If patients still aren’t receiving reminders, check **Reports > Message Log** for delivery status and verify the phone number supports SMS."
}
